  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive quality education and lifelong learning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formal and/or non-formal education for disadvantaged groups enables rights-holders to increasingly have their rights met. NOK 5 milion in additional funds was added autumn 2020 with the goal of contributing to mitigating and prevention against the Covid-19 pandemic in Niger, through strengthening community capacity to prevent and cope with the pandemic, increasing access to education for out-of-school children in communities affected by lockdowns, and improving household resilience against the e</narrative>
  </description>
